# apply-restamp-theirs sources the shared preamble, the in-process lib (inproc.sh, and mutant.sh for its fx_inproc counter, layout.sh), drives apply.sh from copies of the reconcile directory (apply.sh reads many siblings of it), and runs the real pre-push hook in a seeded tree.
